# FTN Platform Website — repository hygiene.
#
# The public website repository contains only what's required to build, deploy, document, and
# legally operate the public website (this repo has no build step and no Cloudflare Pages routing
# config — anything tracked here is servable at its literal path). Internal strategy, governance,
# and knowledge-base material that isn't part of the shipped site does not belong here.
#
# Removed from tracking 2026-07-12 (files preserved locally, moved to a private location for
# internal use) — see the release closeout commit message for the full rationale.
/DESIGN/
/FOUNDATIONS/
/KNOWLEDGE/
/STANDARDS/
/STRATEGY/
/FTN_Strategic_Foundation_v1.0/

# Local browser-test runtime. The public site has no Node build dependency, so this
# must never be shipped or accidentally committed with a static-site release.
/node_modules/

# Local Claude Code tooling state (settings, session lock files) — not part of the shipped site.
/.claude/

# Local wrangler CLI cache (account id/name only, no secret -- the real OAuth token lives outside
# the repo in the CLI's own user-level config). Not part of the shipped site; this repo has no
# Cloudflare Pages/Workers deployment config of its own, so there is nothing for wrangler to build
# here -- this directory only exists because wrangler was used locally to verify Workers AI access.
/.wrangler/
